# ULTRON System Map

Stable pointers to where things live. Read this instead of grepping the repo.

## Memory
- Governed memory (source of truth): `~/.ultron/brain.db` (SQLite + FTS5),
  single writer: the `ultron-memory` sidecar (`~/.ultron/bin/ultron-memory.exe`).
- Session context enters through the SessionStart resume and the per-project
  log in `~/.ultron/cockpit/projects/<id>/estado.json`.
- Dense recall (optional): Qdrant at http://localhost:6333, collection
  `ultron_memory`. `ULTRON_DENSE=0` turns it off and recall stays sparse FTS5.
- Vault index (cockpit scripts): `~/.ultron/brain_index/index.db` over
  `~/.ultron-vault/` (curated markdown).

## Code
- Control Center (Tauri app): `~/.ultron/control-center/`
- Claude Code hooks: `~/.ultron/hooks/scripts/` (live list: `hooks/manifest.json`)
- Cockpit Python tools: `~/.ultron/scripts/cockpit/`
- Skills: `~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`

## Personal area (gitignored, never published)
- `~/.ultron/personal/profile.md` - your free-form profile
- `~/.ultron/personal/known.json` - auto-generated style fingerprint

Customize this file as you add new paths to your workspace.
